   "Atlas/LinearGroups/ReeF4/SpecialLeadingExistence.lean:4:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `/-- On the nonpositive part of the actual grading, the three diagonal adjoint\ncoordinates force both marked diagonal coefficients to vanish. -/\ntheorem IsSpecialVector.diagonal_zero_of_no_positive {m : ℕ} {u : TraceZero F} (hu : IsSpecialVector m u)\n    (hp : ∀ j, 0 < specialAbsoluteGrade j → isotropyCoordinates u j = 0) :\n    isotropyCoordinates u 0 = 0 ∧ isotropyCoordinates u 1 = 0 :=\n  by\n  have h0 : fullAdjointDiag0 (isotropyCoordinates u) = 0 := by rw [← fullAdjointDiag0_actual, hu.adjoint_zero]; rfl\n  have h1 : fullAdjointDiag1 (isotropyCoordinates u) = 0 := by rw [← fullAdjointDiag1_actual, hu.adjoint_zero]; rfl\n  have h2 : fullAdjointDiag2 (isotropyCoordinates u) = 0 := by rw [← fullAdjointDiag2_actual, hu.adjoint_zero]; rfl\n  have hz6 := hp 6 (by decide)\n  have hz7 := hp 7 (by decide)\n  have hz8 := hp 8 (by decide)\n  have hz9 := hp 9 (by decide)\n  have hz14 := hp 14 (by decide)\n  have hz15 := hp 15 (by decide)\n  have hz16 := hp 16 (by decide)\n  have hz17 := hp 17 (by decide)\n  have hz21 := hp 21 (by decide)\n  have hz23 := hp 23 (by decide)\n  have hz24 := hp 24 (by decide)\n  have hz25 := hp 25 (by decide)\n  simp only [fullAdjointDiag0, fullAdjointDiag1, fullAdjointDiag2, hz6, hz7, hz8, hz9, hz14, hz15, hz16, hz17, hz21,\n    hz23, hz24, hz25, mul_zero, zero_mul, add_zero] at h0 h1 h2\n  rw [h2, add_zero] at h0 h1\n  exact ⟨sq_eq_zero_iff.mp h0, sq_eq_zero_iff.mp h1⟩`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
   "level": "warning"},
  {"message":
